<title>FRANCE: France to issue new 5-yr BTAN at July 17 auction.</title>
<headline>France to issue new 5-yr BTAN at July 17 auction.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will issue a new five-year Treasury note, or BTAN, at its July 17 auction and a new two-year BTAN at its September 18 auction, according to the Treasury's calendar for BTAN issuance for the rest of 1997.</p>
<p>The new five-year BTAN will have a maturity date of July 12, 2002 while the two-year note will mature on January 12, 2000, the Treasury said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the coupons for the new BTANs had yet to be determined.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
